What terminal software are you running?  That might help out with the solution.

One thing that I've found can make a difference is whether your backspace
is destructive or not.  If your backspace is set to destructive, set it to
non-destructive.

Also, make sure the termcap file on the machine you're logging into
supports vt102.  You may have to try vt100 instead (keeping your pc
program set to vt102 should be fine).

